      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مرّدهُ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَمْرِيدٌ</span>, (tropical:)  <i>He stripped it</i> (a
branch) <i>of its leaves.</i> (S, A, L.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  (tropical:)  <i>He stripped
