See 1. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مرّدهُ</span>, (A, L,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَمْرِيدٌ</span>, (S, L, K,)
<i>He made it</i> (a building) <i>smooth</i> (S, A, L, K)
<i>and even</i> (L, K) <i>and tall</i> or <i>long;</i> (A;) <i>and
plastered it with mud.</i> (L.)

